{
  "name": "slider",
  "type": "registry:ui",
  "title": "滑动输入 Slider",
  "description": "悬浮时展开轨道、数值标签实时跟随的可调输入控件。",
  "import": "import { Slider, sliderTrackVariants } from \"@/components/ui/slider\"",
  "exports": [
    "Slider",
    "sliderTrackVariants"
  ],
  "typeExports": [
    "SliderProps"
  ],
  "install": {
    "wui": "pnpm dlx @wui-design/cli@latest add @wui/slider",
    "shadcn": "pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add https://ui.wzx.wang/r/slider.json",
    "npmDependencies": [
      "radix-ui",
      "class-variance-authority"
    ],
    "registryDependencies": [
      "utils"
    ]
  },
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": "\"default\" | \"expand\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "default",
        "expand"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "default",
      "description": "Track expansion treatment used on hover and focus."
    },
    {
      "name": "showValue",
      "type": "\"always\" | \"hover\" | \"never\"",
      "required": false,
      "control": "select",
      "options": [
        "always",
        "hover",
        "never"
      ],
      "defaultValue": "hover",
      "description": "Controls when the value label is visible."
    },
    {
      "name": "formatValue",
      "type": "((value: number) => ReactNode)",
      "required": false,
      "control": "text",
      "defaultValue": "(current) => current",
      "description": "Formats the value displayed above each thumb."
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    },
    {
      "name": "asChild",
      "type": "boolean",
      "required": false,
      "control": "boolean"
    }
  ],
  "usage": "`Slider` 用于音量、亮度、缩放和数值范围等连续调整。轨道在悬浮或键盘聚焦时平滑变粗，滑块上方的标签跟随位置并实时显示当前值。",
  "extended": "使用 `showValue=\"hover | always | never\"` 控制浮动标签，通过 `formatValue` 添加百分号、单位或自定义内容。传入两个值即可得到范围选择器，方向键会按照 `step` 调整数值。\r\n\r\n### 满尺寸展开\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n`variant=\"expand\"` 会在鼠标浮入或键盘聚焦时将轨道扩展到 `20px`，与滑块圆点保持相同高度；离开交互区域后平滑收回细轨道。",
  "events": "`onValueChange(values)` 在拖动或键盘调整期间连续触发；需要只在操作完成后提交时使用 `onValueCommit(values)`。组件支持受控与非受控用法。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "name": "slider-demo",
      "title": "基础示例"
    },
    {
      "name": "slider-expand",
      "title": "满尺寸展开"
    }
  ],
  "files": [
    "registry/ui/slider.tsx"
  ],
  "docsUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/docs/components/slider",
  "sourceUrl": "https://ui.wzx.wang/r/slider.json"
}
